{"id":"P051-2","subject":"P","unit":"P051","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P051-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n동기 전동기에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 회전속도가 일정하다. ② 역률의 조정이 불가능하다.\n\n③ 기계적으로 튼튼하다. ④ 효율이 좋다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e10-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m26-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m26-e1.webp","width":678,"height":632}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P051-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n다음 내용의 빈칸에 알맞은 것은?\n\n  3상 동기발전기에 평형 3상 전류가 흐를 때, 전기자\n\n 반작용은 이 전류가 기전력에 대하여 ( ㉠ )때 감자작\n\n 용이 되고, ( ㉡  )때 증자작용이 된다.\n\n\n        ㉠           ㉡\n\n ①        90° 뒤질        동상일\n\n ②        90° 뒤질             90° 앞설\n\n ③        90° 앞설             90° 뒤질\n\n ④      동상일              90° 뒤질","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e10-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m27-q.webp","width":678,"height":757},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m27-e1.webp","width":678,"height":787}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P051-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n변압기 등가회로를 작성하기 위한 시험법에 해당되지 않는\n\n것은?\n\n\n① 단락시험       ② 무부하시험\n\n③ 저항측정시험     ④ 반환부하시험","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e10-m28","number":28},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m28-q.webp","width":696,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m28-e1.webp","width":678,"height":464}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P051-S2-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 29번","searchText":" 29\n\n정격이 2kW, 100V, 20A인 타여자 직류 발전기가\n\n있다. 무부하시의 단자전압과 전부하시 단자전압의 차는\n\n몇 V인가?\n\n(단, 계자전압은 20V, 계자전류가 2A , 전기자 저항이\n\n 0.2Ω, 브러시의 전압강하는 2V이다.)\n\n\n① 2           ② 4\n\n③ 6           ④ 8","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e10-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m29-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m29-e1.webp","width":696,"height":890}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P051-S2-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 30번","searchText":" 30\n\n그림과 같은 전류 파형에 있어서 0으로부터 까지는\n                              A로                        주어sinA로, 로부터 까지는                                       \n진다. A인 경우, 전류의 평균값은 몇 A 인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 약 1.33       ② 약 1.37\n\n③ 약 1.42       ④ 약 1.58","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e10-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m30-q.webp","width":696,"height":757},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m30-e1.webp","width":696,"height":992},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m30-e2.webp","width":678,"height":682}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P051-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\nRLC직렬회로에서 Ω, H , F일\n때, 대역폭은 몇 Hz인가?\n\n\n                           \n①           ② \n\n                            \n③           ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e10-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m31-q.webp","width":678,"height":585},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m31-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1202},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m31-e2.webp","width":696,"height":714}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P051-S2-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 32번","searchText":" 32\n\n전압원의 공급전압이 ∠°V, 내부 임피던스가\nΩ일 때, 여기에 접속된 임피던스 부하에 공급\n\n할 수 있는 최대전력은 몇 약 W인가?\n\n\n① 16          ② 18\n\n③ 20          ④ 32","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e10-m32","number":32},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m32-q.webp","width":678,"height":564},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m32-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1170}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P051-S2-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 33번","searchText":" 33\n\n그림과 같은 회로에서 개방된 2차 단자에 나타나는 유기\n기전력이                   A일 때, 은 몇      sin\nA인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① cos       ② cos\n③ sin       ④ sin","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e10-m33","number":33},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m33-q.webp","width":678,"height":734},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m33-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P051-S2-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 34번","searchText":" 34\n\n회로에서 전압을 인가하면 F의 커패시터에 흐르는                             \n전류는 일반적으로 A로 표현된다.\n\n여기서, 의 값은?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 4.38         ② 6.12\n\n③ 8.75         ④ 11.67","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e10-m34","number":34},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m34-q.webp","width":696,"height":935},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/ele