k/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m36-q.webp","width":678,"height":920},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m36-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1313}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P051-S2-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 37번","searchText":" 37\n\nmH, mF인 다음과 같은 회로에\n교류전압 sinV를 인가할 때, 전체전류가 A ,\n교류전압 sinV를 인가할 때, 전체전류가 A,\n교류전압 sinV를 인가할 때, 전체전류가 A\n라고 할 때, 의 관계가 성립하는 경우, 회로의\n\n저항 은 약 몇 Ω인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 8           ② 10\n\n③ 12          ④ 14","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e10-m37","number":37},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m37-q.webp","width":678,"height":962},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m37-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P051-S2-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 38번","searchText":" 38\n\n3전류계법을 이용하여 단상 교류 부하의 소비전력을 측정하\n려 한다. 각 전류계의 지시값이 A , A ,\nA, 저항값이 Ω일 때, 단상 부하의 소비\n\n전력은 몇 W인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 57.5         ② 62.5\n\n③ 67.5         ④ 72.5","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e10-m38","number":38},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m38-q.webp","width":696,"height":1067},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/e