ation":""}]},{"id":"P051-S2-Q16","number":16,"question":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 41번","searchText":" 41\n\n2전력계법으로 3상 부하의 역률을 계산하고자 한다.\n각 전력계의 지시값이 W, W인 경우, 역률은\n\n어떻게 표현되는가?\n\n\n                \n①            ② \n                \n③            ④ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e10-m41","number":41},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m41-q.webp","width":678,"height":587},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m41-e1.webp","width":696,"height":841}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P051-S2-Q17","number":17,"question":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 42번","searchText":" 42\n\n송전단 전압이 162kV, 수전단 전압이 154kV, 송전단\n\n전압과 수전단 전압의 위상차가 45°, 전체 리액턴스가 40\n\nΩ일 때, 전송전력은 약 몇 MW인가?\n\n\n① 435         ② 441\n\n③ 448         ④ 456","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제)","originalId":"2024h2-e10-m42","number":42},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m42-q.webp","width":678,"height":474},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e10-m42-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1041}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P051-S2-Q18","number":18,"question":"24.08.31 한국서부발전 (매일경제) · 객관식 43번","searchText":" 43\n\n유효낙차가 50m, 유량이 3ms인 수력발전소의 연간\n\n발전전력은 약 몇 MWh인가?\n\n(단, 수차효율